  "story": {
    "day": 34,
    "title": "Kaya's Job Dreams",
    "sentences": [
      "On Wednesday, Ms. Sato's class talked about jobs.",
      "Kaya saw pictures of a doctor and a nurse.",
      "A pilot, firefighter, and police officer also appeared.",
      "Kaya thought, \"I love cooking delicious food.\"",
      "She dreamed of opening a restaurant in London or Paris.",
      "Her friend said, \"You're great at recipes! Let's try one.\"",
      "Kaya imagined visiting Sydney or China someday.",
      "She took her gray umbrella from her locker.",
      "Later, they watched a video about a vet.",
      "An office worker called on the telephone."
    ]
  }
}